v 3
d ntfy. Send push notifications from Stata to a phone or desktop via ntfy
d
d {cmd:ntfy} publishes a message to an ntfy topic (https://ntfy.sh), so
d you get a push notification, e.g. when a long run finishes. Messages are
d sent by Stata's built-in Java: no curl, shell window or extra software.
d
d Author: Barna Szabo, Karolinska Institutet
d Requires: Stata 16 or later
d Distribution-Date: 20261115
f ntfy.ado
f ntfy.sthlp
